## Task Completion Summary

### 1. Built the Library with CMake
- Successfully configured and built the legacy MdfLib (2007-era win32 library) on the current Linux system using CMake and g++
- Build done in `/tmp/mdfbuild` (the MdfLib source directory had filesystem restrictions preventing direct build there)
