### 2. Converter (`test_mdf_loader.cpp`)
The converter was already present in the repository. It:
- Takes `<input.mdf> <output.json>` as arguments
- Loads the .mdf binary file using MdfLib's `CreateFromFile()` API
- Dumps all data as structured JSON including header, textures, animations (timelines/keyframes), and meshes (vertices, indices, bind pose, parent info)

